#. module: scheduled_filter_export
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:scheduled_filter_export.scheduled_export_view_form
msgid ""
"This export runs with the access rights and record rules of the\n"
"                        <strong>Run As</strong> user: the recipients receive exactly the rows that\n"
"                        person is allowed to see, and nothing more. Only a Settings administrator\n"
"                        may pick a user other than themselves.\n"
"                        New exports are <strong>disabled</strong> until you switch Enabled on;\n"
"                        the scheduled action then checks every hour and sends the file on the days\n"
"                        you chose, at or after the hour you set.\n"
"                        A file holds at most the Row Limit shown above — a truncated file says so\n"
"                        on its last line and in the email. If no record matches the filter,\n"
"                        <strong>no email is sent at all</strong>; the run is still recorded here."
msgstr ""

